<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Armon et al. (2011) Science / Efrati et al. (2009) JMPS Incompatible Shell Elasticity & Chiral Seed Pod Opening — MorphoEval overall 54.9/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py` (overall weighted score: 55.8/100). The baseline evaluates the analytical Föppl-von Kármán critical width w_tilde_c and renders a kinematic helical surface, but lacks variational L-BFGS-B minimization of the non-Euclidean incompatible plate energy E = E_stretch + E_bend across w_tilde in [0.5, 10], omits the cutting-angle chirality sweep theta in [0 deg, 90 deg] (including the theta = 0 deg achiral circular ring negative control), omits the multi-specimen comparison, and does not segment the vendored Bauhinia variegata specimen image. Overall 54.9/100 (faithfulness 51.2, reproducibility 63.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 57, Morphological realism / specimen match 45, Parameter expressivity 51, Morphometric validation 54, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 60, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/chiral_seed_pod_opening_comparison.png: rendered output of 2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py at 8871db0, image/png, 179007 B, 1400×630 px, artifact_sha256 565a347e18f3d082b61da91bc7b13667076ca7f24f96f31257d7638fb572b2a9 (sha256 565a347e18f3d082b61da91bc7b13667076ca7f24f96f31257d7638fb572b2a9), spec_fingerprint 0721ebc9afa69617d711a2d91c13ef54394e8e1f4a186543c993ead8f2e0eebf. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 0721ebc9afa69617d711a2d91c13ef54394e8e1f4a186543c993ead8f2e0eebf; artifact_sha256: 565a347e18f3d082b61da91bc7b13667076ca7f24f96f31257d7638fb572b2a9; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/bauhinia_chiral_seed_pod_specimen.jpg=047f357961bc58c5..., datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/chiral_seed_pod_opening_reference.json=9ba8847c46f708bb..., datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/paper_citations.bib=b3a693ac6a538b04..., datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/scout_manifest.json=05711e5e7df6cb17...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Enforce runtime SHA-256 verification of all 4 dataset files, expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 9 quantitative reference-anchored metrics, and upgrade the figure to a 6-panel synthesis layout.",
        "remediation needed: Implement a variational L-BFGS-B energy minimizer for the non-Euclidean incompatible plate energy functional E[H, D, phi] = E_stretch + E_bend across dimensionless width w_tilde in [0.5, 10], reproducing both the narrow Pure-Twist Helicoid regime (w_tilde <= w_tilde_c, H = 0, R = 0) and the wide Cylindrical Helical Ribbon regime (w_tilde > w_tilde_c, H -> (1-nu)*kappa_0/2).",
        "remediation needed: Implement computer-vision segmentation of `datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/bauhinia_chiral_seed_pod_specimen.jpg` (*Bauhinia variegata* MHNT.BOT.2011.3.22), isolating the dehisced twisted valves, intact pre-dehisced flat pod, and helical twist crossings/lobes.",
        "remediation needed: Implement the cutting-angle chirality sweep across theta in [0 deg, 90 deg], verifying that theta = 45 deg maximizes helical twist tau = D*sin(2*theta) while theta = 0 deg and theta = 90 deg serve as achiral circular ring controls (tau = 0, pitch P = 0), plus zero-shrinkage (kappa_0 = 0) flat pod control." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.49e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

